{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"instruction"}}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"de-Hebr"}}
{"text":"וואֶהרענד ד״א געמיינדע "}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"הוּא אֳלֹהֵֽינוּ"}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" א״ז״וו זאַגט, ספריכֿט דער חזן פֿאַלגענדע: לייזע:"}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en","resp":"urn:x-opensiddur:contributor:opensiddur.org/codex"}}
{"text":"While the congregation says “He is our God”, the cantor says the following verses quietly."}
{"end":"t:foreign"}
{"tail":" "}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n                    "}
