{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"instruction","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"he"}}
{"text":"הש״ץ חוזר בקול רם הוא אלהינו וכו׳."}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n                        "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en","resp":"urn:x-opensiddur:contributor:opensiddur.org/codex"}}
{"text":"The cantor repeats the following aloud."}
{"end":"t:note"}
